[0.000, "o", "  ? SA-10        insufficient-evidence  conf:high    evidence:0\r\n      gap: Human attestation is required: evidence of documented human review and named reviewer sign-off for model 'churn-predictor-v1' changes prior to deployment cannot be machine-retrieved from AWS. A human must attest to this control by providing a linked artifact (e.g., change review record, approval ticket, deployment checklist with named approver) demonstrating that model changes underwent documented review before deployment to endpoint 'churn-predictor-endpoint'.\r\n"]
